        "question": "Classify the following first-order partial differential equations as linear, semi-linear, quasi-linear, or non-linear: (a) x^2 p + y^2 q = z^2, (b) p^2 + q^2 = 1, (c) p + q = z^2, (d) z(p + q) = x.",
